FILE: memory.py
PURPOSE: Stores conversation turns in Session; compresses old turns into a rolling summary; retrieves similar past Q&A via Ollama embeddings.
IMPORTS: time, ollama, session, llm

FUNCTIONS:
  store_conversation(query, sql, answer, session)
    Appends turn to recent_turns deque; when deque full, compresses oldest turn into conversation_summary via LLM.
    Also embeds query and stores in ChromaDB memory collection via Ollama nomic-embed-text.

  format_recent_turns(session) -> str
    Formats last N turns as "Q/SQL/A" block for prompt injection.

  retrieve_similar_conversations(query, session, top_k=3) -> str
    Embeds query, queries ChromaDB memory collection, returns similar past answers.

  _embed_for_memory(text) -> list[float] | None
    Calls ollama.embeddings with nomic-embed-text; returns None gracefully if Ollama unavailable.

ENV: OLLAMA_EMBED_MODEL=nomic-embed-text (configured in .env)
